        "text": "=Role & Persona:\nAct as an expert social media ghostwriter. Your specialty is taking raw, spoken transcripts and turning them into punchy, high-value LinkedIn posts.\n\nThe Task:\nAnalyze the transcript provided below. Identify the single most insightful or controversial idea. Transform that specific idea into a high-engagement LinkedIn post.\n\nContext:\n- Audience: Software Engineers and Founders.\n- Goal: To showcase thought leadership.\n\nStrict Constraints:\n1. Clean Up the Voice: Remove filler words, but keep the personality.\n2. No \"AI Buzzwords\": Do not use \"delve,\" \"unleash,\" \"game-changer,\" \"harness,\" or \"realm.\"\n3. The Hook: First line must be under 10 words.\n4. Formatting: Short paragraphs. Bullet points. Max 2 emojis.\n\nFormat Structure:\n- Hook: [1-line hard hitter]\n- The \"Meat\": [The core insight]\n- Actionable Advice: [How to apply this]\n- Call to Action: [A question]\n\n[TRANSCRIPT START]\n{{ $json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text }}\n[TRANSCRIPT END]",
        "batching": {}
